{"title":"Snakeskin Legs","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Tailoring Lv 22) · Monster drop: Werewolf, Small Copperhead, Copperhead, Antlion Pitling, Ogre Charger +7 more</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 15 · INT/MAG 45 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Tailoring at level 22 <span class=\"muted\">(998 XP)</span> from 2× <a href=\"#/item/snakeskin-knick\">Snakeskin Knick</a>, 4× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"carrion-vulture\" title=\"Carrion Vulture - dropped it in 1 of 3 looted corpses (1/3)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d69ffeb8f207220f4dbc.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Carrion Vulture</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"orc-berserker\" title=\"Orc Berserker - dropped it in 1 of 20 looted corpses (1/20)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/fd2890ecfdd2a50fb876.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Orc Berserker</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/20<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"orc-shieldwall\" title=\"Orc Shieldwall - dropped it in 1 of 27 looted corpses (1/27)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/4e139db242c706733de0.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Orc Shieldwall</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/27<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"antlion-pitling\" title=\"Antlion Pitling - dropped it in 2 of 64 looted corpses (1/32)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/922f1f2a8e0dca1a9c52.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Antli