ior</span></td><td>-30%</td><td>0.7 armor · 1.7 magic defense</td><td>10% blows · 22% spells</td><td class=\"muted\">2 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/snakeskin-legs?q=crude\" title=\"Show it at Crude\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-crude\" src=\"data/img/fd826e0571f2523a171c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-crude\">Crude</span></td><td>-20%</td><td>0.8 armor · 1.9 magic defense</td><td>11% blows · 24% spells</td><td class=\"muted\">1 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/snakeskin-legs?q=shoddy\" title=\"Show it at Shoddy\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-shoddy\" src=\"data/img/fd826e0571f2523a171c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-shoddy\">Shoddy</span></td><td>-10%</td><td>0.9 armor · 2.2 magic defense</td><td>13% blows · 26% spells</td><td class=\"muted\">2 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/snakeskin-legs?q=ordinary\" title=\"Show it at Ordinary\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/fd826e0571f2523a171c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">Ordinary</span></td><td>0%</td><td>1 armor · 2.4 magic defense</td><td>14% blows · 29% spells</td><td class=\"muted\">13 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/snakeskin-legs?q=good\" title=\"Show it at Good\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-good\" src=\"data/img/fd826e0571f2523a171c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-good\">Good</span></td><td>+10%</td><td>1.1 armor · 2.6 magic defense</td><td>15% blows · 31% spells</td><td class=\"muted\">2 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/snakeskin-legs?q=excellent\" title=\"Show it at Excellent\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-excellent\" src=\"data/img/fd826e0571f2523a171c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">Excellent</span></td><td>+22%</td><td>1.2 armor · 2.9 magic defense</td><td>17% blows · 33% spells</td><td class=\"muted\">3 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/item/snakeskin-legs?q=superior\" title=\"Show it at Superior\"><td><img 